  "prefLabel": "Ins 301.09 Electronic Sales",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 301.09 Electronic Sales. Electronic sales of life insurance as described in RSA 420-Q shall be subject to the identical disclosure and record keeping requirements as non-electronic sales.\n\nSource. #12423, eff 2-5-18 (from Ins 301.08); ss by #13691, eff 7-21-23",
